eal._ProductionAttempter reached eval_solver.run_case for G3 and failed before model evaluation with RuntimeError: agentic filesystem tools was attempted OUTSIDE the repo-snapshot gate process. The first attempt also showed .rebar/fixture_heal_manifests was not created before fixture_selection.write_manifest.\\n\\n## Impact\\nThe scheduled/live fixture-heal path can be unavailable for agentic/container criteria even after the corpus contains faithful child material. This is distinct from lovesick-missing-andeancat, which fixed the persisted material and admission semantics.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- [ ] The production fixture-heal live path creates its work directories before writing manifests.\\n- [ ] Agentic/container criterion admission runs inside gate_source.gate_read_root (attested snapshot or explicit local) rather than requiring REBAR_GATE_ALLOW_UNGATED.\\n- [ ] A regression test proves G3/G4 live admission reaches the solver under the required gate context or records an explicit unavailable result without crashing the sweep.\\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"da2f-b473-0494-4e36","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Fixture heal live run lacks gate context","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["531410c7-5c45-43d7-8041-d74564ab6d64","d944aec8-4eba-402b-98f0-d9dd5fd0d5e0"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789021390450426156,"uuid":"e3633bbc-0da1-4c19-8f96-019008e3002d"}